   "text": "✗ **h_pan_allele_tobit_kernel** · hypothesis\n\nLens 1 (BD2009-only pan-allele length-aligned anchor-bulge + censored-Tobit kernel + bilinear allele-factorization) achieves mean blind AUC >= 0.893322 and >= 60/87 wins on the 87 Blind datasets\n\n*why dead:* [L-IMBB-001=0] Lens 1 reached 87-dataset mean Blind AUC = 0.887763 (57/87 wins vs NetMHC=0.883322, beating all 3 reference methods on 9-mers, 10-mers [0.8414 vs 0.8319], 11-mers [0.9495 vs 0.9238], and 20 smallest size_cv datasets [+0.0158]), +0.0044 above NetMHC; pivoting to Model-Space Supertype Ensemble + Exon-2/Exon-3 Split + Training-Time Matrix Completion in Lens 2",
   "x": 0,
