   "text": "✗ **h_lens2_model_space_supertype_and_p1_p2_p3** · hypothesis\n\nLens 2 (Model-Space Supertype Ensemble + Exon-2/Exon-3 Modular Pocket Transfer + Training-Time Matrix Completion + CV Optimism Shrinkage + BD2013 Leakage Audit) achieves p1 (>= +0.02 on 20 smallest datasets), p2 (CV-Blind optimism gap <= 0.0217 with Blind AUC >= 0.883322), p3 (exact BD2013 contamination curve), and pushes 87-dataset Blind AUC past 0.890+\n\n*why dead:* [L-IMBB-002=0] Lens 2 + Lens 1 Empirical Bayes scarcity synergy reached 0.889556 Mean Blind AUC (0.889379 Pure Sequence) with 57/87 wins vs NetMHC (p=0.00501 < 0.01), 47/87 vs NetMHCpan, 74/87 vs SMM-PMBEC, and certified all 3 partial-win targets: p1 (20 smallest by size_cv = 0.850861, +0.020823 vs NetMHC and +0.021548 vs NetMHCpan; Pure Seq = 0.850714, +0.020676 vs NetMHC), p2 (zero-fold-leakage homology-damped 5-fold cv_rnd = 0.907408, gap = 0.017852 vs NetMHCpan gap 0.034553/0.031700, shrinkage = +0.016701/+0.013848 >= 0.01), and p3 (exact post-2009 contamination curve across f in 0%..100%).",
